WEBVTT

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:03.660
My passionate idol activities,

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.370
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.530
Seira, you don't know about PowaPuri?

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.490
Is it really that surprising to you?

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.950
Well...

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.540
"Powa Powa Puririn!"

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.780
"Powa-ring up!"

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.540
You know?

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.290
But I <i>don't</i> know.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.050
So you knew about them, Noelle?

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.290
Yeah, of course!

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.550
Powa Powa Puririn is Starlight Academy's number one popular unit! {I can't wrap my head around what you want to say}

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:40.510
And their leader, Arisugawa Otome-chan, is the current Starlight Queen.

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:43.510
In other words, she's at the top of Starlight Academy,

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.810
Yeah, come to think of it, I remember something like that.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:50.480
They're our friendly rivals, so at least pretend you're interested!

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.190
And just as we speak,

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.200
there's been new PowaPuri news!

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.220
"Today, PowaPuri is going to this wonderful sweets shop Ichigo-tan told us about

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:03.070
for a taste-and-compare!" it says.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:05.830
But I feel like I've seen this place before.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:08.250
Wait, isn't that my place?!

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.150
It's just like Ichigo-tan said!

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:15.470
Seira-tan's house is wonderful!

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.940
The Otome Special.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.690
Okay, here you go.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:00.660
Thanks!

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.160
Here, thanks for waiting.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.080
Looks delicious!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:12.080
Mom, I got PowaPuri's autographs!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.460
My, sorry to disturb you during your private hours.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.830
We don't mind.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:20.220
Imbuing our feelings towards our fans in a pen,

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.050
we etch our marks on the paper,

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:26.640
and create an autograph bond!

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:27.470
So it's fine.

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:31.350
Wow, Kitaouji Theater! Awesome!

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.480
Oh yeah, is Seira-tan not home today?

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.980
Well, about Onee-chan...

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.070
Talk about "speak of the PowaPuri"!

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.160
Why are we hiding from them?

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.530
This is my house.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:52.370
Eating a parfait on a cold day is cool and Love You!

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.880
The Mont Blanc is delicious as well.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.420
The Gateau Chocolat is great too. {or chocolate cake}{no, need fancyness}

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.570
Now, let's compare them!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:04.180
They're all Love You!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.870
They each have their own appeal. {oh damn, it's symbolism}

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.870
Exactly.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:13.190
Powa Powa Puririn was founded as an independent idol unit centered around Arisugawa Otome-chan.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:17.440
From the very beginning, the actual activities they do has been a complete mystery.

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:21.930
Their carefree and laid-back antics captured the hearts of many fans.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:24.950
Now, they've grown to the point where they even have a show named after themselves.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.200
People call them "cuttlefish idols". {is "dried" necessary}{no}

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.370
Cuttlefish?

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.270
The more you bite into them, the more flavor you get.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.680
I see.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.660
Noelle-tan, we'll come again!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.710
Okay!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.330
See you!

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:45.530
Now, let's start tracking them!

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.210
Wait, are we really going to?

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.720
See you later, Onee-chan!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:54.240
Today's challenge will be seeing how far we can walk along this white line!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.070
What's the point of this?

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:59.980
I'm sure there'll be something lucky waiting for us at the end! {...}{what is this a rainbow?}

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.340
So that shall be today's setting, yes?

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:02.860
Yeah!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.740
But where's the end, exactly?

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:12.870
This is a chance to collect data on the mysterious PowaPuri!

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:15.840
This kind of stuff doesn't really suit my image.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.990
It's the same as when I went to Hoshimiya Ichigo's house.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.920
Did you say something about me?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.540
I knew it!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.840
Seira-chan and Kii-chan!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.590
What are you two do—

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.640
Ah, it's Arisugawa Otome-chan!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.830
Isn't that PowaPuri?

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:36.350
I don't know what you're up to today, but do your best!

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.900
Thank you!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.400
It's really hard to tell.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.450
Since PowaPuri is so mysterious and all,

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.400
we're secretly observing them.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.330
Sounds fun!

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:51.370
You're acting like a real Chocopop Detective!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.360
Hearing you say that is a bite embarrassing.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:56.660
Nice! As expected from the Chocopop Detective!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.680
I wasn't making a joke! {best I can do at this time}

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:02.370
I was actually really curious about PowaPuri myself.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:06.150
After all, there are so things about PowaPuri we don't know.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:09.310
Like maybe they do some intensive training in secret.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.730
Powa Powa! Puririn!

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.930
Powa Powa! Puririn!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.930
Pay close attention!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:20.190
Like taking note of every detail of fan-acquisition graphics! {this is Kii}

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:24.190
We have a pie chart, a bar graph, and a line graph!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:27.080
I can't imagine it at all.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.090
Alright!

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:31.760
Today, we'll do a thorough 
investigation of what they really do!

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:35.520
We'll expose every last bit of 
PowaPuri's appeal and power!

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.700
Chocopop Detectives plus me!

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.140
Dispatch!

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.390
Hey, that's my catchphrase!

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:42.350
Dispatch!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.440
Oh? What are you up to today?

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:53.720
We're following that cloud to see where it goes.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.810
You must be hungry.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:57.930
Take these on your way.

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.530
Thank you! {nanodesu}

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:02.980
Sorry for all our trouble.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.470
Don't worry about it.

00:07:04.470 --> 00:07:07.740
Looking at you girls makes me all warm inside.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.450
Time to eat! {whatever}

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.670
Aw, that looks really good.

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:14.090
There we go.

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:19.000
The keyword is "warm". They're like the opposite of you, the rocker.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.250
Really?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.750
Yeah. Warm, as in they're all fluffy and hot.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.460
So are you calling me cold?

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:30.940
No, no. You're sharp and action-oriented. {man, action-oriented sounds like the perfect meaningless resume word}

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:32.260
That's fine, I guess.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:35.140
My complete opposite, huh.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.530
Aikatsu.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:38.640
Aikatsu. Aikatsu.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.400
Is this Aikatsu?

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:45.660
Even if it's just cleaning, anything Otome-sama has fun with is considered Aikatsu.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:47.650
It's PowaPuri!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:50.050
Hey, hey, what are you doing?

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.610
We're doing leaf-gathering Aikatsu!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.130
So this is Aikatsu?

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.730
So this is Aikatsu!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:56.780
I want to do it too!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:03.730
Then let's split into an Otome team, a Sakura-tan team, and a Shion-tan team and have a leaf-gathering contest!

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:04.500
Okay!

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:09.010
Now then, whoever wants to be on Shion-oneesan's team...

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:12.550
Me, me! I do!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.800
Okay, okay! Everyone who wants to be on Otome's team!

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:21.830
The free-spirited Otome-chan, the level-headed Shion-chan,

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.990
and the responsible Sakura-chan who follows them up. {???}

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.730
Individually, their personalities don't match at all...

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.820
...but somehow they balance each other out?

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:29.730
Yeah!

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:33.320
It's like a Japanese-Western-Chinese fusion deluxe bento!

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.630
I don't know about that analogy.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.390
Huh, what's wrong?

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:45.210
Nothing, I just felt like someone was watching us...

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:48.810
We gathered a whole lot!

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.460
It looks like a tie.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.140
Everyone, thanks for helping out.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:56.470
It's cold!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.390
I know!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:00.730
Let's warm our bodies with a game of tag!

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:02.850
Otome will be it first!

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.230
Gao! {stegosaurus, obviously}

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:09.650
Now I think I get why PowaPuri is so popular.

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:14.200
Just watching Otome-chan makes me want to join them.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.470
That's it!

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:18.550
PowaPuri's laid-back nature creates a sense of closeness

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:21.170
and drastically shortens the distance between them and their fans.

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:24.250
Powa Powa Puririn might be even more interesting than I originally thought! {this was an example mistake for my english teaching}

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.770
Bye-bye!

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:28.250
Bye-bye! {nanodesu}{don't even know}

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:31.110
Kids sure have lots of energy.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:32.790
Good work today.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:34.780
Alright, that's a wrap!

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.030
That was wonderful!

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:39.850
I got lots of great footage today! {I can't believe they got this guy back}

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:42.010
Quiet!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.530
Ichigo-tan?

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.230
You were filming for their show?

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:52.860
Yes. The best way to capture their appeal is to hide the camera from them.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.100
That makes sense.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:57.860
That's why I filmed in secret today.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:01.630
"Powa Walking", a five-minute segment in the morning has started airing.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:06.790
Tales of the most laid-back group in Japan spread via word of mouth, leading to their current popularity. {time, space, etc}

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.150
So a show like that is on TV?

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.880
That's pretty amazing.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:13.380
<i>PowaPuri really is interesting.</i>

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:16.230
<i>They're completely different from us,</i>

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:19.590
<i>but I'm looking forward to seeing how that laid-back nature of theirs manifests itself on stage.</i>

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:24.110
If I knew you were there, I would've asked you to play with us.

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:24.860
Yeah.

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:28.480
But I felt how fun PowaPuri was just by watching you.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:32.670
Ichigo-sama, PowaPuri is not a unit that is solely fun.

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:33.900
What? Really?

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.030
Really?

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.150
Is that true?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:40.110
The three of us are having a fashion show the day after tomorrow.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:44.770
Please come witness how far we've come.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.740
Sure! I'm really looking forward to it!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:47.650
Sorry.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:51.670
It turns out I can't go to the fashion show.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:07.450
Shion-chan, you can't go to the fashion show?

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.890
It's not PowaPuri without all three of you.

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:13.170
Shion-sama, do you have to film something for your drama?

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:15.530
They want to start filming earlier than planned.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.500
What should we do about Shion-tan's replacement?

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.860
If you want a replacement...

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:22.870
Me?!

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.590
There, we found one!

00:11:24.590 --> 00:11:26.660
Ichigo-tan, can you do it?

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:29.680
Sorry, I have work that day.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.920
What a letdown...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.130
Um, can't you just go with two people?

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:37.910
PowaPuri has to be three people!

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:44.140
All the fans have been looking forward to our Triangle PowaPuri Light.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.390
Triangle PowaPuri Light?

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.640
It's our very own Special three-person Appeal. {capitalization?}

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:53.520
But even if you get a replacement, you won't have much time to practice...

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:59.850
Sakura-tan! PowaPuri's next activity is to find a replacement for Shion-tan!

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:00.690
Yes!

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:01.330
Sorry.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.030
Don't worry about it!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:04.450
Go for it.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.950
You're making me nervous for you.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:11.060
That's part of why PowaPuri's so popular.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:14.970
It's fine to surprise your fans, but it's another thing to let them down...

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:16.540
I'm sure it'll work out somehow.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.460
Alright!

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:23.050
Powa Powa Puririn! Powa-ring up! {did I say how good this was?}

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.930
Please!

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:28.360
PowaPuri's looking for someone to fill in.

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:30.650
Yurika-tan! I'm begging you!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.560
Come PowaPuri with us!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:37.820
Huh? Why would a descendant of 
Count Dracula himself ever join PowaPuri?

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.820
Back in the day, it'd be off with your head! {wow, hisashiburi}

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:45.260
But if you're really that desperate, I don't think I might not agree not to be a replacement for you.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:48.910
Though once I join, the leader will naturally be Yurika-sama.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:51.330
And all the outfits will be Loli Gothic.

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:53.870
Yes, I see it! I can see it!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:58.590
The Ruler of Darkness Yurika-sama featuring PowaPuri!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.650
Don't you see it too?

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:01.950
Hey, she's gone!

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:03.590
I'll suck your blood!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.590
Please!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.820
Sorry.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.890
Fashion shows aren't really my thing.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.100
I see.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.790
By the way, you've changed a lot, Sakura.

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:22.000
You used to be such a timid girl, but now you've gotten so assertive.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:25.110
I'm sure it's all thanks to Otome-sama.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:35.370
Otome-chan and company are really going at it.

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:45.240
But it might be hard to find a replacement.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.920
Huh? Why?

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:50.800
It might look like all PowaPuri does is goof off...

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:53.110
...but Otome is the reigning Starlight Queen.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.560
And Sakura is a top-class second-year.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:14:00.160
You need an incredible amount of strength just to keep up with them.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.440
I see!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.270
Ichigo?

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:09.280
While I was in America, Otome-chan and Sakura-chan have both grown so much as idols.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.780
Yeah. Same with Shion-chan.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.050
The lead actress, Kamiya Shion-san.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.910
I look forward to working with you.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:21.040
She's steadily climbing the ladder of actressdom.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.710
Please!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.050
Please!

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:29.590
Okay! I'm going to do whatever I can to help Otome-chan and them out!

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:35.930
One! Two! Three! Four!

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.890
One! Two! Three...

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.890
Sorry to barge in.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.940
Oh, Ichigo-tan!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:43.280
What brings you here at this hour?

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:46.900
I can't be a replacement, but I can at least help you practice.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.340
Ichigo-sama!

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:49.660
Thanksies! {hsuogtjcwe}

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:54.280
I was just thinking that it wasn't really working without three people.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:57.160
Thank you for your concern.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:00.830
I'm just happy I get to finally do Aikatsu with you after all this time!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.140
Ichigo-tan!

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:03.790
Love!

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:11.930
PowaPuri's entry hasn't been canceled yet.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.750
So you <i>are</i> worried about PowaPuri.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.180
N-Not really.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:19.630
If you're that worried, let's go to the fashion show!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.310
Let's go, go!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:23.840
Fine, if you want to go.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.030
That's it for today's shoot!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.820
Good work, everyone!

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:35.900
Hello?

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.090
Otome-chan, have you found a replacement yet?

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.460
Aye! Well, not yet.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.390
But we'll be fine!

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:46.720
Just focus on your own work!

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.450
Okay. Thanks.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:54.850
<i>They still don't have a replacement.</i>

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.990
<i>And this was all my fault to begin with.</i>

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:00.070
<i>I have to do something!</i>

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.870
It's almost time for the show to start.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.120
Got it.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.950
Looks like they couldn't find a replacement.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:21.620
Yeah.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:26.380
<i>Show me how you stand up to this adversity, Powa Powa Puririn.</i>

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:30.070
It's almost your turn. Are you going to enter with just you two?

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:30.720
No.

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:31.790
We'll be fine!

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.380
PowaPuri is a trio!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.140
Are you really going to be fine?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.480
Express delivery!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:40.500
Looks like it came right on time.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.390
Shion-tan, thank you!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.400
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:52.230
Hi!

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:53.870
Package from Shion!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:57.280
One-day limited-edition Powa Powa Puririn-version Ichinose Kaede!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.810
Let's do this, Otome, Sakura!

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:04.480
Kaede-tan, let's do this indeed!

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.040
Um, what about the choreography?

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:07.540
I've got it down pat.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:11.550
Shion gave me some serious lessons on how to do it.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:14.310
If we're going to do this, let's do the best we can!

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:16.730
Let's give our fans a fun show! {Kaede is all about the tanoshii}

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:19.460
I'm so fired up I'm gonna burst into flames!

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:21.310
Let's do this with all we've got!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:22.560
Powa! {now I think about alpha timing it every time this happens}{you still could}

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.560
Powa!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.430
Puri...

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:26.440
...rin!

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:46.050
That was so fun! {Das hat den großten Spaß gemacht}

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:52.060
We gave all of our fans a really fun concert, didn't we?

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.060
Yep!

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:58.250
Sakura-tan, Kaede-tan, and even Otome had tremendous amounts of fun!

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:02.320
And all of our love should've reached the fans as well!

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:05.930
Ah, it's from Shion-tan!

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:06.820
Hello!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.580
Shion-tan, did you see our performance?

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:11.440
Yeah!

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:13.580
You all PowaPuri'd to the max.

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:18.890
Shion-sama, you were so busy with your filmings and you still found time to find us a replacement!

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.090
Of course I did.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:23.090
After all, I'm part of PowaPuri.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.340
Shion-chan appeared on the super popular variety show "Tuna Palace".

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:30.850
So Kaede-chan, won't you join PowaPuri?

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:32.600
It'll be tons of fun.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.590
A replacement for PowaPuri?

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:35.600
Me?

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.970
We have a fashion show tomorrow.

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:40.740
This is really short notice, ya know?

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.610
It'll be pretty tough, Kaede.

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:44.360
Okay, I'll do it.

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:45.670
You said okay?!

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:47.860
You're biting off a bit much, Kaede.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:50.400
But PowaPuri sounds like fun.

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:51.980
Do you know, Maguro-san?

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:54.620
Powa Powa Puririn, Powa-ring up!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:58.380
There's TV coverage of the whole 
replacement-finding process from start to end.

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:02.290
Everyone's going to be talking about this!

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:04.130
You're really something, PowaPuri.

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:08.890
Everyone did great today!

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:10.930
It was a good fashion show.

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:13.010
Yeah, you were really cute!

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.340
Kaede-chan fit in perfectly, too.

00:22:15.340 --> 00:22:16.390
Thank you.

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:18.760
To a fabulously successful fashion show...

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:20.900
And an incident-less shooting for Shion-sama...

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:23.080
Cheers!

00:23:55.790 --> 00:23:57.830
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:00.580
You did a great job as a replacement.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:03.870
Yes! PowaPuri was really lots of fun.

00:24:03.870 --> 00:24:06.620
You're an honorary member of PowaPuri.

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:07.630
Thank you.

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:09.970
Even as a replacement, give it your all!

00:24:10.910 --> 00:24:12.580
Big big big news!

00:24:12.580 --> 00:24:16.640
Kazesawa Sora-chan has started her own brand!

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:18.640
Let's get along, me-colored brand.

00:24:19.040 --> 00:24:20.060
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.550 --> 00:24:21.930
Sparkle Drip Magic.

00:24:21.930 --> 00:24:24.110
Always passionate, idol activities!
